{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2020-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1602806400, "end_date": 1603497599, "month_true_total": 160, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:59:19 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "78038747", "author": {"steamid": "76561198262251865", "personaname": "LumpyPoofter", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lumpsplays/", "num_games_owned": 542, "num_reviews": 428, "playtime_forever": 47, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 47, "last_played": 1603403645, "avatar": "1ba0f2fe872ad7a477134c69800dea085f86d1b9"}, "language": "english", "review": "As someone with 0 interest in the 40k franchise, this game is completely forgettable. I only played for an hour but didn't find a single thing to get interested in or excited about. Everything seemed generic, from the enemies to the gameplay to what I saw of the plot. Maybe this is good if you like the franchise, but if you just want a beat-em-up third person action game you can do A LOT better than this. Hell, Bayonetta is 10$ cheaper than this.\n\nP.s. go watch some Lumps Plays on the YouTubes.", "timestamp_created": 1603489215, "timestamp_updated": 1603489215, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.304878026247024536", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "78012875", "author": {"steamid": "76561197980185230", "personaname": "iWaNN", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/iWaNN/", "num_games_owned": 326, "num_reviews": 180, "playtime_forever": 5312, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3673, "last_played": 1725646365, "avatar": "357d14a6df49c9ac8758787065add1da4f624f91"}, "language": "english", "review": "